reviewer: claude-opus-5-5 (self-review)
audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: Who decides the issue tracker, labels and agent permissions for unresolved items?

Records the decision that the standard holds tracker rules (when to register, required fields, closing evidence) while the project declares provider, labels and agent permissions in vcs.tracker.
Translated from Korean to English as a frozen record; the always-human fixing of accept-risk and commit-deadline, the follow-up link gate and decision item #27 are preserved.
Headings mapped to Decision / Context and constraints / Rationale and alternatives / Consequences.
Korean literals kept: `영향 및 후속 작업` (line 26) is the actual MR section heading in packages/vcs-gov/commit-contract.yaml, and `없음` (line 74) is the contract's value for "nothing remains"; both glossed in English.
The reversed order relative to docs/design/0003 (connect to workflow first, no manual ledger) is kept without added rationale.

